message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Coastal Reclamation Impact on Invasive Species Distribution: A Species Distribution Modeling Approach"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-01-23
authors:
  - family-names: "Kang"
    given-names: "Binyue"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yourusername/InvasionSDM"
keywords:
  - "species distribution modeling"
  - "invasive species"
  - "coastal reclamation"
  - "biomod2"
  - "GAM"
  - "SEM"
  - "ecological modeling"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  This repository contains the complete workflow for analyzing the impact of 
  coastal reclamation on invasive species distribution using Species Distribution 
  Modeling (SDM). The project processes data for 800+ invasive plant species across 
  global coastal cities and builds ensemble SDM models to assess invasion risk.
